  "content_text": "Enjoy the rest of your day.\nDon’t forget the pirate hat — no pirate is complete without one.\n\nIn fact, the answer is fairly simple, and can be summed up in two words: ambient noise.\n[事实上，问题的答案非常简单，简单到可以用两个字来概括：周围的杂音。]\n\nWith so much to do, a little fun can stop things from feeling overwhelming.\n[事情那么多时，给生活加点乐趣，就不会觉得一切都压得喘不过气。]\n\nIt’s funny how after visiting China my enthusiasm for the country has been tempered.\n[没想到的是，去了一趟中国后，我对这个国家的热情反而冷静了下来。]\n\n\n\nI've never done any cooking and I'm not about to start now.\n[我从来没有做过饭，也不想从现在开始做起来。]\n\nRemind me to hang out the clothes in an hour.\n\nI hope he can help people cope with their problems if they need it. \n[cope with 应对/克服/处理任何困难]",
