          "end_time": 32.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "In fact, the answer is fairly simple, and can be summed up in two words: ambient noise.",
          "start_time": 6.15,
          "end_time": 11.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 32.625,
          "end_time": 32.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "事实上，问题的答案非常简单，简单到可以用两个字来概括：周围的杂音。",
          "start_time": 6.15,
          "end_time": 11.875,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 32.625,
          "end_time": 32.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "With so much to do, a little fun can stop things from feeling overwhelming.",
          "start_time": 11.875,
          "end_time": 16.725,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 32.625,
          "end_time": 32.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "事情那么多时，给生活加点乐趣，就不会觉得一切都压得喘不过气。",
          "start_time": 11.875,
          "end_time": 16.725,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 32.625,
          "end_time": 32.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s funny how after visiting China my enthusiasm for the country has been tempered.",
